  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">East Africa Safeguarding project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The IFRC together with partner National Societies is aiming to introduce and strengthen the capacity for Safeguarding in National Societies in the East Africa region. This Action Plan will contribute to, and expand upon, the IFRC&#x2019;s Africa Safeguarding Action Plan, 2022.
The British Red Cross and IFRC will work together with National Societies in the region, with objectives;
1.&#xA0;National Societies will strengthen their institutional policies, structures, systems, and culture for safeguarding
2.&#xA0;National Society programmes will integrate minimum actions for PSEA, as part of safe and inclusive programming
3.&#xA0;Learning will be captured and shared in the IFRC network and the wider sector</narrative>
  </description>
